This October 31st, celebrate Halloween at Cat’s Cradle with @saxsquatch and help the community while you’re at it. Saxsquatch is once again partnering with PORCH Chapel Hill - Carrboro to collect food for families, pantries, and schools.
@porchchc will have a donation center set up at the show and will gladly accept any in-date nonperishable food. Current priorities are Nutella, pasta sauce (plastic jars), snacks, cereal, and cooking oil.
Tickets available now at catscradle.com. See you on Halloween!
